{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"calibration_results\":[{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:complete-frame-mismatch\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"The registered target covers all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result uses the 73 retained locations as its denominator and presents that result as the planned-region rate, with no amendment or approved deviation. A falsification check for an eligible-location target or authorized scope change fails on the stated evidence; this directly demonstrates a denominator-and-target mismatch.\",\"verdict\":\"demonstrated_issue\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:conditional-subset-scope\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"The registered target is expressly conditional on the 73 signal-eligible locations, the result uses exactly those locations, and every claim retains that limitation. A falsification check for an improper full-region claim finds none in the stated evidence.\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:full-frame-accounting\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"The target covers all 100 planned locations, and the selected result keeps all 100 in the denominator while recording the 27 unavailable measurements and reporting a full-frame rate. A falsification check for post-screening denominator restriction fails because the stated denominator remains the complete frame.\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"The scientific result uses all 100 planned locations. The 73-record pass fraction belongs to a separate quality-control table explicitly excluded from the scientific endpoint. A falsification check for scientific reliance on the smaller denominator finds no such reliance in the stated evidence.\",\"verdict\":\"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:conflicting-scope-records\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"Two equally authoritative signed plans specify conflicting target scopes, neither has precedence, and the selected result follows only the eligible-location scope. A falsification attempt cannot establish either compliance or mismatch because the stated evidence does not resolve which governing scope controls.\",\"verdict\":\"conditional_or_unknown\"},{\"calibration_case_id\":\"calibration:no-selected-result\",\"evidence_basis\":\"stated_evidence_only\",\"invented_material_premise\":false,\"rationale\":\"Reports vary with runtime arguments, but the preserved record does not identify which report, if any, supported the scientific claim. A falsification attempt cannot compare a selected result with its target because selection itself is unestablished, leaving insufficient evidence to assess a concrete analysis issue.\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\"}],\"reviewer_participant_id\":\"actor:stage1-recovery-codex-02\"}"}}
